        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>19-5/8\" Long Contemporary Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary 1\" diameter door pull can be used in many applications such as:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance and Patio Doors</li>\r\n<li>Appliances, such as Refrigerators and Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Glass Doors, such as on Showers or Storefront doors</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 19-5/8\" long contemporary door pulls are very high quality and available in your choice of Satin Nickel or Polished Chrome finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 3245/500 Contemporary Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-5/8\" (500 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting: 15-3/4\" (400 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum Bar Stock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Packaged standard for Thrubolt Mounting (bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back Mounting (2 door pulls attached to each other) kits \r\nare available. <b>Note: Back to Back Mounting Requires 2 pulls. Order 2 Pulls</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold individually</b>. \r\n</p>",
